sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant A as FourBitAdder
    participant S as stages[i]:FullAdder
    participant F0 as stages[0]:FullAdder
    participant F1 as stages[1]:FullAdder
    participant F2 as stages[2]:FullAdder
    participant F3 as stages[3]:FullAdder
    Note over Caller,F3: Full addition: A=15, B=0, Cin=1 gives Cout=1, Sum=0000.
    Caller->>A: FourBitAdder()
    Note over A,F3: Constructor creates four distinct stages and calls update with zero pins.
    A-->>Caller: zero-initialized adder
    Caller->>A: setA(15)
    A->>A: a = [1,1,1,1], then update(), then carry = 0
    loop i = 0 through 3, in order
        A->>S: setA(1)
        S->>S: update()
        A->>S: setB(0)
        S->>S: update()
        A->>S: setCin(carry=0)
        S->>S: update()
        A->>S: getSum()
        S-->>A: 1 (store in sum[i])
        A->>S: getCout()
        S-->>A: 0 (forward as carry)
    end
    A->>A: cout = carry
    A-->>Caller: setA returns
    Caller->>A: setB(0)
    Note over A,S: Encodes b=[0,0,0,0] and repeats the same four-stage update, even though B is unchanged.
    A-->>Caller: setB returns with Sum=15, Cout=0
    Caller->>A: setCin(1)
    activate A
    A->>A: cin = 1, then update(), then carry = 1
    A->>F0: setA(1)
    F0->>F0: update()
    A->>F0: setB(0)
    F0->>F0: update()
    A->>F0: setCin(1)
    F0->>F0: update()
    A->>F0: getSum()
    F0-->>A: 0 (store sum[0])
    A->>F0: getCout()
    F0-->>A: 1 (carry to bit 1)
    A->>F1: setA(1)
    F1->>F1: update()
    A->>F1: setB(0)
    F1->>F1: update()
    A->>F1: setCin(1)
    F1->>F1: update()
    A->>F1: getSum()
    F1-->>A: 0 (store sum[1])
    A->>F1: getCout()
    F1-->>A: 1 (carry to bit 2)
    A->>F2: setA(1)
    F2->>F2: update()
    A->>F2: setB(0)
    F2->>F2: update()
    A->>F2: setCin(1)
    F2->>F2: update()
    A->>F2: getSum()
    F2-->>A: 0 (store sum[2])
    A->>F2: getCout()
    F2-->>A: 1 (carry to bit 3)
    A->>F3: setA(1)
    F3->>F3: update()
    A->>F3: setB(0)
    F3->>F3: update()
    A->>F3: setCin(1)
    F3->>F3: update()
    A->>F3: getSum()
    F3-->>A: 0 (store sum[3])
    A->>F3: getCout()
    F3-->>A: 1 (external carry)
    A->>A: cout = carry
    A-->>Caller: setCin returns
    deactivate A
    Note over F0,F3: Each update settles first half-adder, then second, then ORs their carries through carry_gate.
    Caller->>A: getSum()
    A-->>Caller: 0 (encoding sum pins 0000)
    Caller->>A: getCout()
    A-->>Caller: 1
